OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 8 Sep to Thu 17 Sep
OL,6,FOverall, a fairly unsettled period is
OL,7,Flikely to begin this period with many
OL,8,Fplaces seeing showers or longer spells
OL,9,Fof rain at times, interspersed by
OL,10,Fdrier periods. Rain is likely be most
OL,11,Ffrequent across northern and western
OL,12,Fareas, while the south and east are
OL,13,Fmore likely to see longer drier
OL,14,Finterludes. There is also the
OL,15,Fpotential for some strong and gusty
OL,16,Fwinds at times, particularly in the
OL,17,Fnorthwest. Temperatures are likely to
OL,18,Fbe near average. However, further into
OL,19,Fmid-September, more settled weather is
OL,20,Flooking increasingly likely, bringing
OL,21,Fdrier conditions with lighter winds
OL,22,Fand perhaps some warmer conditions too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
