PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1788441521
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 17 Sep to Thu 1 Oct
OL,6,FConfidence is low from mid-September
OL,7,Fonwards, however a gradual transition
OL,8,Ftowards slightly more settled
OL,9,Fconditions for the second half of the
OL,10,Fmonth is currently signalled. The
OL,11,Fdistribution of rainfall is uncertain
OL,12,Fat this range, but drier conditions
OL,13,Fcompared to earlier in the month are
OL,14,Flikely for most, with any wetter
OL,15,Fspells generally more likely across
OL,16,Fthe northwest. Temperatures are likely
OL,17,Fto be around average overall, although
OL,18,Fsome warm spells are possible,
OL,19,Fparticularly in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
